Medium", "pause_after": "Short (0.36s)", "tts_tag": "[happy]", "tts_tag_score": 7, "speaker_id": "role_2", "speaker_name": "张明", "role_label": "HM", "turn_sound_requests": [], "turn_event_requests": [], "start_time": 324.0458, "end_time": 333.0041}, {"turn_id": 40, "speaker": "AI", "text": "<注释>欣喜</注释>哎哟那可太好了！小宝要是来了，这阳台肯定热闹得不行，不过小雅平时上班也挺辛苦的啊。", "emotion": "欣喜", "tts_prompt": "六十多岁女性声音，语气欣喜，带着关心。", "speech_rate": "Medium", "pause_after": "Short (0.24s)", "tts_tag": "[happy]", "tts_tag_score": 7, "speaker_id": "role_1", "speaker_name": "张秀兰", "role_label": "AI", "turn_sound_requests": [], "turn_event_requests": [], "start_time": 333.3641, "end_time": 341.7775}, {"turn_id": 41, "speaker": "HM", "text": "小雅还说要早点过来瞅你的新花园呢，到时候我俩在厨房给你打下手，你就负责炒那俩菜，剩下的时间专心陪小宝玩。", "emotion": "愉快", "tts_prompt": "年轻男性声音，语气愉快，分享好消息。", "speech_rate": "Medium", "pause_after": "Short (0.37s)", "tts_tag": "[happy]", "tts_tag_score": 7, "speaker_id": "role_2", "speaker_name": "张明", "role_label": "HM", "turn_sound_requests": [], "turn_event_requests": [], "start_time": 342.0175, "end_time": 353.2139}, {"turn_id": 42, "speaker": "AI", "text": "行，就按你说的来。咱们娘俩分工合作，这顿暖房酒肯定办得热热闹闹的，倍儿有面。", "emotion": "满意", "tts_prompt": "六十多岁女性声音，语气满意，充满期待。", "speech_rate": "Medium", "pause_after": "Short (0.32s)", "tts_tag": "[happy]", "tts_tag_score": 7, "speaker_id": "role_1", "speaker_name": "张秀兰", "role_label": "AI", "turn_sound_requests": [], "turn_event_requests": [], "start_time": 353.5839, "end_time": 361.8649}, {"turn_id": 43, "speaker": "HM", "text": "<注释>笑</注释>那就这么说定了啊。你这茉莉花茶是真好喝，我再倒两杯喝去。", "emotion": "轻松", "tts_prompt": "年轻男性声音，带笑，语气轻松，满意。", "speech_rate": "Medium", "pause_after": "Short (0.20s)", "tts_tag": "[happy]", "tts_tag_score": 6, "speaker_id": "role_2", "speaker_name": "张明", "role_label": "HM", "turn_sound_requests": [], "turn_event_requests": [], "start_time": 362.1849, "end_time": 367.9111}, {"turn_id": 44, "speaker": "AI", "text": "香吧？这是你二舅特意给我带的新茶，等下周他们来了，咱就在这阳台上摆上茶具，边喝边唠。", "emotion": "得意", "tts_prompt": "六十多岁女性声音，语气得意，分享。", "speech_rate": "Medium", "pause_after": "Short (0.36s)", "tts_tag": "[happy]", "tts_tag_score": 7, "speaker_id": "role_1", "speaker_name": "张秀兰", "role_label": "AI", "turn_sound_requests": [], "turn_event_requests": [], "start_time": 368.1111, "end_time": 377.4052}, {"turn_id": 45, "speaker": "HM", "text": "没问题，到时候我负责给长辈们端茶递水。你这小藤椅肯定不够坐，我回头再给你买俩好看的小圆凳配上。", "emotion": "积极", "tts_prompt": "年轻男性声音，语气积极，主动安排。", "speech_rate": "Medium", "pause_after": "Short (0.33s)", "tts_tag": "[happy]", "tts_tag_score": 7, "speaker_id": "role_2", "speaker_name": "张明", "role_label": "HM", "turn_sound_requests": [], "turn_event_requests": [], "start_time": 377.7652, "end_time": 387.077}, {"turn_id": 46, "speaker": "AI", "text": "买那干啥浪费钱，老房子带过来的那俩折叠凳擦一擦就能用，挺好的。<HM turn_id 47>那凳子<fade_end>结实着呢，别总乱花钱。", "emotion": "节俭", "tts_prompt": "六十多岁女性声音，语气节俭，觉得没必要。", "speech_rate": "Medium", "pause_after": "Short (0.25s)", "tts_tag": "[neutral]", "tts_tag_score": 5, "speaker_id": "role_1", "speaker_name": "张秀兰", "role_label": "AI", "text_complete": "买那干啥浪费钱，老房子带过来的那俩折叠凳擦一擦就能用，挺好的。那凳子结实着呢，别总乱花钱。", "turn_sound_requests": [], "turn_event_requests": [], "start_time": 387.407, "end_time": 394.9674}, {"turn_id": 47, "speaker": "HM", "text": "<user_interrupt>那哪能行啊，新家就得有新样子，折叠凳放这阳台上多违和啊。你别管了，这事我来办，保证跟你这藤椅特搭。", "emotion": "坚持", "tts_prompt": "年轻男性声音，语速较快，语气坚决，坚持要买新凳子。", "speech_rate": "Fast", "pause_after": "Short (0.24s)", "tts_tag": "[angry]", "tts_tag_score": 6, "speaker_id": "role_2", "speaker_name": "张明", "role_label": "HM", "interruption_type": "反驳", "reason": "检测到信号(b)：舞台指示含打断。", "turn_sound_requests": [], "turn_event_requests": [], "start_time": 394.4074, "end_time": 405.0444}, {"turn_id": 48, "speaker": "AI", "text": "你这孩子就是花钱大手大脚的。行吧，别买太贵的就行。你看这满屋子的太阳，我心里真的特舒坦。", "emotion": "无奈", "tts_prompt": "六十多岁女性声音，语气无奈，但带着满足。", "speech_rate": "Medium", "pause_after": "Short (0.34s)", "tts_tag": "[happy]", "tts_tag_score": 6, "speaker_id": "role_1", "speaker_name": "张秀兰", "role_label": "AI", "turn_sound_requests": [], "turn_event_requests": [], "start_time": 405.2943, "end_time": 414.4541}, {"turn_id": 49, "speaker": "HM", "text": "你舒坦我就放心了。忙活了一上午我总算能松口气，等下周末暖房酒一办，亲戚们一来，这新家就彻底热闹起来了。", "emotion": "放松", "tts_prompt": "年轻男性声音，语气放松，充满期待。", "speech_rate": "Medium", "pause_after": "Short (0.37s)", "tts_tag": "[happy]", "tts_tag_score": 7, "speaker_id": "role_2", "speaker_name": "张明", "role_label": "HM", "turn_sound_requests": [], "turn_event_requests": [], "start_time": 414.7941, "end_time": 425.6901}, {"turn_id": 50, "speaker": "AI", "text": "可不是嘛，以后周末你带小雅和小宝常过来，那才叫真的热闹呢。", "emotion": "期待", "tts_prompt": "六十多岁女性声音，语气期待，温馨。", "speech_rate": "Medium", "pause_after": "Short (0.27s)", "tts_tag": "[happy]", "tts_tag_score": 7, "speaker_id": "role_1", "speaker_name": "张秀兰", "role_label": "AI", "turn_sound_requests": [], "turn_event_requests": [], "start_time": 426.06, "end_time": 432.8156}, {"turn_id": 51, "speaker": "HM", "text": "放心吧妈，咱们本来就约好每周都来看你的，现在有了这大阳台，小宝估计来了都赖着不想走了。", "emotion": "安慰", "tts_prompt": "年轻男性声音，语气安慰，轻松。", "speech_rate": "Medium", "pause_after": "Short (0.28s)", "tts_tag": "[happy]", "tts_tag_score": 6, "speaker_id": "role_2", "speaker_name": "张明", "role_label": "HM", "turn_sound_requests": [], "turn_event_requests": [], "start_time": 433.0855, "end_time": 442.1761}, {"turn_id": 52, "speaker": "AI", "text": "<注释>开心</注释>那敢情好啊，我巴不得他天天来呢。我这几盆小多肉，我还打算教小宝怎么给它们浇水呢。", "emotion": "开心", "tts_prompt": "六十多岁女性声音，语气开心，充满期待。", "speech_rate": "Medium", "pause_after": "Short (0.24s)", "tts_tag": "[happy]", "tts_tag_score": 8, "speaker_id": "role_1", "speaker_name": "张秀兰", "role_label": "AI", "turn_sound_requests": [], "turn_event_requests": [], "start_time": 442.4561, "end_time": 450.7244}, {"turn_id": 53, "speaker": "HM", "text": "<注释>打趣</注释>那你可得看紧点，小宝那调皮鬼，别一高兴给你把花盆都掀翻了，到时候你这宝贝花园遭了殃，可别哭鼻子啊。", "emotion": "调侃", "tts_prompt": "年轻男性声音，语气调侃，开玩笑。", "speech_rate": "Medium", "pause_after": "Short (0.29s)", "tts_tag": "[happy]", "tts_tag_score": 7, "speaker_id": "role_2", "speaker_name": "张明", "role_label": "HM", "turn_sound_requests": [], "turn_event_requests": [], "start_time": 450.9644, "end_time": 460.6951}, {"turn_id": 54, "speaker": "AI", "text": "小宝才没那么捣蛋呢，他可乖了。就算真打翻了，大不了我再重新种呗，就当陪我大孙子玩了。", "emotion": "维护", "tts_prompt": "六十多岁女性声音，语气维护，慈爱。", "speech_rate": "Medium", "pause_after": "Short (0.31s)", "tts_tag": "[happy]", "tts_tag_score": 7, "speaker_id": "role_1", "speaker_name": "张秀兰", "role_label": "AI", "turn_sound_requests": [], "turn_event_requests": [], "start_time": 460.9851, "end_time": 470.0155}, {"turn_id": 55, "speaker": "HM", "text": "得，在你眼里啊，小宝干啥都是对的，就是个完美的小天使。", "emotion": "无奈", "tts_prompt": "年轻男性声音，语气无奈，但带笑。", "speech_rate": "Medium", "pause_after": "Short (0.29s)", "tts_tag": "[happy]", "tts_tag_score": 6, "speaker_id": "role_2", "speaker_name": "张明", "role_label": "HM", "turn_sound_requests": [], "turn_event_requests": [], "start_time": 470.3254, "end_time": 476.768}, {"turn_id": 56, "speaker": "AI", "text": "<注释>笑出声</注释>那可不咋的。来，茶都快凉了，赶紧把这杯喝完。暖房酒的事儿定下来，我心里的石头总算落地了。", "emotion": "开心", "tts_prompt": "六十多岁女性声音，笑出声，语气开心，满足。", "speech_rate": "Medium", "pause_after": "Short (0.21s)", "tts_tag": "[happy]", "tts_tag_score": 9, "speaker_id": "role_1", "speaker_name": "张秀兰", "role_label": "AI", "turn_sound_requests": [], "turn_event_requests": [], "start_time": 477.058, "end_time": 487.4522}], "theme_meta": {"theme_mode": "topics", "source": "conversation_scenarios.json", "topics_json": "/nfs-speech-ali-nnn/zhaoshuofeng/workplace/full_duplex/audio-drama-writer_copy/config/generated/uncovered/conversation_scenarios.json", "category_id": "C14", "category_name": "乔迁搬家与装修翻新", "core_focus": "Relocation & Home Renovation", "sub_genre": "乔迁暖房邀请", "content": "邀请名单、聚会形式、时间协调、礼物建议、房间布置、食物准备分工", "dialogue_style": "", "sub_type": "乔迁暖房邀请", "label": "C14 / 乔迁搬家与装修翻新 / 乔迁暖房邀请"}, "source_path": "/nfs-speech-ali-nnn/zhaoshuofeng/workplace/full_duplex/audio-drama-writer_copy/output/mixed_rich_5000_all_0821/topics1/张秀兰与张明